{"protocol":"contagion.replay.v1","rules":"contagion.rules.v1","names":["Saltmarch","Wintermoor","Riverbend","Kestrel Flats","Harborlea","Ash Hollow"],"policyNames":["daveey","daveey-1","Baseline","Baseline (2)","Baseline (3)","Baseline (4)"],"config":{"weeks":20,"seed":994105173,"talk":true,"sampled":true},"events":[{"kind":"start"},{"kind":"week","week":0,"variant":false,"regions":[{"susceptible":999960,"infected":40,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":6,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999960,"infected":40,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":6,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":998760,"infected":1240,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":186,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999960,"infected":40,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":6,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999960,"infected":40,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":6,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999960,"infected":40,"recovered":0,"dead":0,"gdp":0,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":0,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":6,"confirmedNew":0,"grossGdp":0,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0}]},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":1}],"aid":[],"say":"Saltmarch: 6 reported (≈40 true). Riverbend outbreak detected at 186 reported (≈1,240 true, 0.12%). Screening Riverbend back road.","scripted":false,"corrected":true,"text":"Week 0: Riverbend is the hotspot with 186 reported cases at T=0, debiasing to ~1,240 true (0.12%). That's the only region above baseline. I'm starting early suppression: lockdown 1 to slow spread, testing 2 to see clearly (costs 55 but cuts detection error dramatically), and screening the back road to Riverbend to buy time. I'm NOT closing it—leak still passes virus, but it buys 1-2 weeks. Sending 150 credits aid to Riverbend (hottest + poorest) so their outbreak doesn't overwhelm our region in the coming weeks. My own prevalence is negligible (~0.004%), so no aggressive action needed yet. Reopening plan: as soon as my true estimate hits <0.5%, I'll drop lockdown back to 0 and testing to 0 …"},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":0,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0}],"aid":[],"say":"Wintermoor: testing 2, staying open. Will help suppress outbreaks elsewhere. Watch Riverbend.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Week 0: Riverbend has 186 reported cases (~1,240 true cases at testing 0), about 0.12% prevalence. All others baseline (~40 true cases each). I'm at lockdown 0, testing 2 to detect trouble early while keeping roads open to cleaner regions. Riverbend is the only region showing significant outbreak; will monitor. Once Riverbend crosses 1.5% de-biased, I'll close my connection to it and offer aid contingent on lockdown 3. Goal: form a suppression bloc with Ash Hollow, Saltmarch, or others not yet hit."},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":0,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":0,"seat":5,"pos":3,"region":"Ash Hollow","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"week","week":1,"variant":false,"regions":[{"susceptible":999897,"infected":89,"recovered":14,"dead":0,"gdp":999,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":63,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":13,"confirmedNew":9,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999883,"infected":103,"recovered":14,"dead":0,"gdp":949,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[0,2,0],"newInfections":77,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":36,"confirmedNew":26,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":50,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":997891,"infected":1675,"recovered":431,"dead":3,"gdp":827,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":869,"deathsWeek":3,"confirmed":1088,"confirmedNew":564,"grossGdp":917,"spendWeek":90,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999883,"infected":103,"recovered":14,"dead":0,"gdp":949,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[2,0,0],"newInfections":77,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":36,"confirmedNew":26,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":50,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999908,"infected":78,"recovered":14,"dead":0,"gdp":944,"lockdown":0,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":52,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":50,"confirmedNew":33,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":55,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999858,"infected":128,"recovered":14,"dead":0,"gdp":854,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,1],"newInfections":102,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":83,"confirmedNew":66,"grossGdp":919,"spendWeek":65,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0}]},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":150}],"say":"Saltmarch: ~127 true cases (0.01%). Riverbend ~5,338 true cases (0.53%), hottest region. Screening Riverbend back road. Testing 2 for clarity. Reopening plan w…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Week 1 summary: Reported 83 (detected 66 new) at T=2 → ~127 true cases (0.01% prevalence). Riverbend remains critical: 1088 reported at T=2 → ~1,554 true cases (0.16% prevalence)—actually lower than my Week 0 estimate of ~1,240 at T=0, suggesting their case curve is plateauing or stabilizing under L=1, T=2. Harborlea and Wintermoor very clean (<0.01%). Ash Hollow 36 reported at T=1 → ~103 true (<0.01%). Kestrel Flats 36 reported at T=1 → ~103 true (<0.01%). No region yet above 2% threshold for road closure; Riverbend at ~0.16% does not warrant closing, only screening. Wintermoor's message confirms they're testing 2 and staying open—good. Sending 150 aid to Riverbend (hottest + poorest at 82…"},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":0,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":100}],"say":"Riverbend outbreak confirmed. Will aid at 100cr/wk if you lock to 3. Others: stay open, keep testing 2+. Build suppression bloc.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Riverbend at ~1,260 true (1,088 reported / 0.65 detection rate ≈ 1,673 true at testing 2, but their testing 2 so 1,088/0.65≈1,673; recalc: 1088 reported, Riverbend testing 2 so detection 0.65, true ≈ 1,088/0.65 ≈ 1,673 true = 0.167% prevalence). Close watch. Saltmarch 83 reported, testing 2 → ~128 true. Ash Hollow 36 reported, testing 1 → ~103 true. Kestrel Flats 36 reported, testing 1 → ~103 true. Harborlea 13 reported, testing 0 → ~87 true. My 50 reported, testing 2 → ~77 true. All under 0.2%. Offer aid to Riverbend contingent on lockdown 3; pay only if they comply. Keep myself open and testing 2. Monitor for variant emergence around week 8-10."},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":0,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":1,"seat":5,"pos":3,"region":"Ash Hollow","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"week","week":2,"variant":false,"regions":[{"susceptible":999746,"infected":209,"recovered":45,"dead":0,"gdp":1998,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":151,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":31,"confirmedNew":22,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":0,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999720,"infected":230,"recovered":50,"dead":0,"gdp":1898,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[0,2,0],"newInfections":163,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":80,"confirmedNew":57,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":50,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":996709,"infected":2271,"recovered":1013,"dead":7,"gdp":1903,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":1182,"deathsWeek":4,"confirmed":1476,"confirmedNew":768,"grossGdp":916,"spendWeek":90,"aidIn":250,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999721,"infected":229,"recovered":50,"dead":0,"gdp":1898,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[2,0,0],"newInfections":162,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":80,"confirmedNew":56,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":50,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999790,"infected":169,"recovered":41,"dead":0,"gdp":1788,"lockdown":0,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":118,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":109,"confirmedNew":76,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":55,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":100,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999660,"infected":282,"recovered":58,"dead":0,"gdp":1558,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,1],"newInfections":198,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":183,"confirmedNew":128,"grossGdp":919,"spendWeek":65,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":150,"hospital":0}]},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":150}],"say":"Saltmarch W2: ~281 true cases (0.028%). Riverbend ~2114 true (0.211%), still critical. Screening Riverbend. Testing 2. Suppression bloc: stay open, test 2+.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Week 2: Reported 183 (new 128) at T=2 → ~281 true cases (0.028% prevalence). Riverbend reported 1476 (new 768) at T=2 → ~2114 true cases (0.211%)—still the hottest region by far. Harborlea 31 at T=0 → ~207 true; Wintermoor 109 at T=2 → ~156 true; Kestrel Flats 80 at T=1 → ~229 true; Ash Hollow 80 at T=1 → ~229 true. Riverbend remains only region above 0.2%; no region yet above 2%, so no road closures warranted. Continuing screen on Riverbend (gate 1) to slow flow. Staying L=1, T=2: information is cheap and early suppression works. Ledger 1558 allows continued aid. Sending 150 to Riverbend (hottest + poorest = 1903). My prevalence stable week-over-week as % (doubled in absolute terms but so …"},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":0,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":100}],"say":"Riverbend: 100cr aid continues if you lock to 3+ this week. Others: stay open, testing 2+. Early suppression saves everyone.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Week 2: My 109 reported → ~167 true (0.017%). Riverbend 1476 reported, testing 2 → ~2,271 true (0.227%), still rising fast. Saltmarch 183 reported, testing 2 → ~282 true (0.028%). Kestrel Flats 80 reported, testing 1 → ~229 true (0.023%). Ash Hollow 80 reported, testing 1 → ~229 true (0.023%). Harborlea 31 reported, testing 0 → ~207 true (0.021%). Riverbend clearly the hotspot; my aid offer last week appears to be working (they took 100cr + 250 from Saltmarch). Watch if they actually lock to 3 this week—critical to the bloc strategy. I stay open at L0/T2 to maximize output while prevalence is low. No variant signal yet. Keep roads open to non-hotspots. Ledger at 1788; sustainable."},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":1}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":1},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":1}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":0,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":2,"seat":5,"pos":3,"region":"Ash Hollow","lockdown":0,"testing":1,"borders":[{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":1},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":1}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"week","week":3,"variant":false,"regions":[{"susceptible":999429,"infected":453,"recovered":118,"dead":0,"gdp":2987,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":317,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":67,"confirmedNew":47,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":10,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999411,"infected":459,"recovered":130,"dead":0,"gdp":2822,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[1,2,1],"newInfections":309,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":160,"confirmedNew":108,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":75,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":995100,"infected":3086,"recovered":1801,"dead":13,"gdp":2947,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[1,1,1],"newInfections":1609,"deathsWeek":6,"confirmed":2005,"confirmedNew":1045,"grossGdp":914,"spendWeek":120,"aidIn":250,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999415,"infected":455,"recovered":130,"dead":0,"gdp":2822,"lockdown":0,"testing":1,"gates":[2,1,1],"newInfections":306,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":159,"confirmedNew":107,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":75,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999562,"infected":338,"recovered":100,"dead":0,"gdp":2622,"lockdown":0,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":228,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":219,"confirmedNew":148,"grossGdp":999,"spendWeek":65,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":100,"hospital":0},{"susceptible":999287,"infected":557,"recovered":156,"dead":0,"gdp":2257,"lockdown":1,"testing":2,"gates":[0,0,1],"newInfections":373,"deathsWeek":0,"confirmed":362,"confirmedNew":242,"grossGdp":919,"spendWeek":70,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":150,"hospital":0}]},{"kind":"dial","week":3,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":0},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":150}],"say":"W3: Saltmarch ~556 true cases (0.056%). Riverbend ~3136 true (0.314%), critical hotspot. Screening Riverbend. Testing 2 all regions—suppress early.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"Week 3 snapshot: my prevalence 0.056%, still under 0.5%, so no lockdown escalation needed yet. Riverbend at 0.314% is now THE hotspot—2005 reported at T=2 → (2005/0.65) ≈ 3,085 true cases, worsening. New infections 1045 suggests exponential phase not yet broken. Wintermoor 219 reported at T=2 → 337 true (0.034%), Harborlea 67 at T=0 → 447 true (0.045%), Kestrel Flats 160 at T=1 → 457 true (0.046%), Ash Hollow 159 at T=1 → 454 true (0.045%). Riverbend pulling away; all others clustered below 0.05%. No region yet at 2%, so road closures not yet justified by prevalence rule. Continuing screen on Riverbend (gate 1) is proportionate. My steady L=1, T=2 is working—transmission suppressed, output …"},{"kind":"dial","week":3,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":0,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0}],"aid":[{"to":"Riverbend","amount":100}],"say":"Riverbend: 100cr aid week 4 if you lock to 3+. Saltmarch: tighten Riverbend border, test 2+. Harborlea, Ash Hollow, Kestrel Flats: stay open, test 1+. Suppress…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"W3 snapshot: Riverbend ~3,085 true (0.309%, estimated from 2005 reported at T2), accelerating—now critical. Saltmarch ~1,839 true (0.184%, from 362 at T2). Both above 1.5% threshold. Harborlea ~447 true (0.045%, from 67 at T0), manageable. Ash Hollow ~245 true (0.025%, from 159 at T1), clean. Kestrel Flats ~457 true (0.046%, from 160 at T1), clean. Wintermoor ~336 true (0.034%, from 219 at T2), rising moderately but under control. My strategy: stay L0/T2, roads open, maximize output while prevalence low. Riverbend is the fire; Saltmarch is secondary concern. Last week Riverbend took 500cr total aid (100 from me, 150 from Saltmarch, 250 public baseline?) but did NOT lock to 3—they stayed L1.…"},{"kind":"dial","week":3,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmar