00 aid to Harborlea (poorest of hotspots, 9756 ledger but 4.72% outbreak incoming). Deaths 23→63 last week but now stable; …"},{"kind":"dial","week":10,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":1,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Harborlea","amount":200}],"say":"W10→W11: Wintermoor 1.25% stable under L1. Harborlea ~14.5% catastrophic—200cr now if L3 by W11. Bloc strategy: Riverbend/Ash/Kestrel hold L2/T2, Wintermoor L1…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"W10 snapshot: Wintermoor ~12521 true (1.25%, still under control at L1/T2). Harborlea reported 7087 → ~47247 true (4.7%, catastrophic—untested, exponential)—must intervene immediately with aid + public condition. Riverbend ~10666 true (1.067%, just crossed threshold but L2/T2 holding); Ash Hollow ~7610 true (0.761%, L2 working); Kestrel Flats ~7938 true (0.794%, L2 stable); Saltmarch ~8845 true (0.885%, L3 suppressing well but ledger depleted at 5854). Variant suspected (transmission rates elevated across board). Strategy: (1) Maintain L1/T2 in Wintermoor—we are the economic anchor and must stay open to fund aid. (2) Keep Ash/Kestrel screened (both L2/T2, both under 1%); they form a suppres…"},{"kind":"dial","week":10,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":2,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":2},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":2},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":10,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":2,"testing":2,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":10,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":3,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":10,"sea