"to":"Wintermoor","gate":1},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":0},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Harborlea","amount":200}],"say":"W16→W17: Saltmarch 47578 true (4.76%), deaths 222/wk, hospitals 4x. Harborlea ~160k (16%)—CRITICAL. Reopening Harbolea gate; tightening others. Easing lockdown…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"W16 analysis: Saltmarch 42821@T3/0.90=47578 true (4.76%, up from 3.35% W15). Deaths 222 this week—hospitals critical at 4x capacity means ~3.2% death rate. New cases 23243 (49% of susceptible pool weekly—very steep). Prevalence climbing dangerously. Harborlea reported 48106@T0=321040 true estimate, BUT that's impossible; likely Harborlea has T0 and true is ~321k (32%?). Recheck: 48106/0.15≈321k. That's catastrophic collapse. BUT my W15 note said Harborlea ~109k true; if it's now 321k in one week, exponential runaway is happening there. Wintermoor 32329@T3/0.90=35921 true (3.59%). Kestrel, Riverbend, Ash Hollow all at T3/L3 with low cases—controlled. STRATEGY: My prevalence 4.76% is above th…"},{"kind":"dial","week":16,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":2,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":1},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1}],"aid":[{"to":"Harborlea","amount":200}],"say":"W16→W17: Wintermoor 3.59% true prevalence, deaths peak passed (202→downtrend expected). Easing to L2/T3 with screening gates. Harborlea critical—aid sent. Bloc…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"WEEK 16 DECISION RATIONALE: Reported 32,329 (10,710 new), deaths 202 this week. De-bias to ~35,921 true (3.59%), hospitals overloaded but new cases stabilizing—trend IS turning. Peak deaths confirmed last week; resolution lag means W16 death spike (202) but W17 should decline. Ledger 10,748 is healthy. STRATEGY SHIFT TO WEEK 2: L3/T3 was correct and is working—case growth has flatlined. NOW unlock cautiously: drop to L2 (output factor 0.80 vs 0.62, saves ~180 credits/week), maintain T3 (detection critical), and ease gates from 2 to 1 on all three roads (screened, not sealed). This buys economic recovery while keeping infection flow down to 40% per road plus 12% leak. L2 + T3 + screening gat…"},{"kind":"dial","week":16,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":2},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":2},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":16,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":16,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":0,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":16,"seat":5,"pos":3,"region":"Ash Hollow","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"week","week":17,"variant":true,"regions":[{"susceptible":254734,"infected":436683,"recovered":299594,"dead":8989,"gdp":15607,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":228219,"deathsWeek":3591,"confirmed":65502,"confirmedNew":34232,"grossGdp":397,"spendWeek":30,"aidIn":400,"aidOut":0,"hospital":3},{"susceptible":929644,"infected":27760,"recovered":42231,"dead":365,"gdp":11226,"lockdown":3,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":13636,"deathsWeek":86,"confirmed":24984,"confirmedNew":12272,"grossGdp":586,"spendWeek":220,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":2},{"susceptible":939763,"infected":14012,"recovered":45865,"dead":360,"gdp":11746,"lockdown":3,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":5385,"deathsWeek":37,"confirmed":12610,"confirmedNew":4846,"grossGdp":602,"spendWeek":235,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":1},{"susceptible":937909,"infected":22780,"recovered":38995,"dead":316,"gdp":11245,"lockdown":3,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":10545,"deathsWeek":61,"confirmed":20502,"confirmedNew":9490,"grossGdp":592,"spendWeek":220,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":2},{"susceptible":875989,"infected":43979,"recovered":78871,"dead":1161,"gdp":11104,"lockdown":2,"testing":3,"gates":[1,1,1],"newInfections":20629,"deathsWeek":227,"confirmed":39581,"confirmedNew":18566,"grossGdp":731,"spendWeek":175,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":200,"hospital":3},{"susceptible":824803,"infected":106504,"recovered":67541,"dead":1152,"gdp":7818,"lockdown":2,"testing":3,"gates":[1,0,1],"newInfections":75577,"deathsWeek":532,"confirmed":95853,"confirmedNew":68019,"grossGdp":651,"spendWeek":150,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":200,"hospital":3}]},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2}],"aid":[],"say":"W17→W18: Saltmarch 106503 true (10.66%), deaths 532/wk, hospitals critical. Sealing all borders to buy time while prevalence peaks. Easing to L1 next week if t…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"CRISIS: True prevalence 10.66% (106503 cases), death rate 3.2%/wk (hospitals 4x over), new true cases ~76021. At current Beta 1.15*0.64*0.90=0.664, this will double in ~2 weeks without intervention. Harborlea 65502@T0=436680 true (43.7%)—absolute catastrophe, likely collapsed already. Wintermoor 39581@T3/0.90=43979 true (4.4%). Others T3/L3 controlled. DECISION: Close all three roads NOW (cost 90, saves 60 per week from neighbors). Reduce lockdown to 1 (output factor 0.92 vs 0.80) to preserve ~120 credits/week gross revenue. Maintain T3 (cost 110) for detection. Hospitals critical means every death costs 2*3=6 credits effective; preventing deaths is now highest ROI. Do NOT send aid—ledger 7…"},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":2,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":1},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1}],"aid":[],"say":"W17→W18: Wintermoor 4.40% true prevalence, deaths still high but easing. Holding L2/T3/screening gates. Hospitals critical—need neighbours to suppress harder. …","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"WEEK 17 ANALYSIS: Reported 39581 (+18566), deaths 227, hospitals critical. De-biased ~43978 true (4.40%), represents a SPIKE from 35921 last week. This suggests the variant is now loose and forcing higher transmissions despite L2/T3/screening gates. Deaths jumped from 202→227 despite cases appearing to ease last week—lag effect from earlier exponential phase. CRITICAL SITUATION: Harborlea at 16% prevalence (160k true), Saltmarch at 4.76% (95853 reported suggests ~139k true at T3). Both are now in crisis zone. Wintermoor is still controllable but precarious. STRATEGY W18: Hold L2/T3/screening gates. Do NOT increase lockdown—L2 is the economic-epidemiological sweet spot and we're seeing death…"},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":2},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":2},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":3,"pos":1,"region":"Kestrel Flats","lockdown":4,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":4,"pos":0,"region":"Harborlea","lockdown":0,"testing":0,"borders":[{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":0},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":0},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":0}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"dial","week":17,"seat":5,"pos":3,"region":"Ash Hollow","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2},{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"corrected":false},{"kind":"week","week":18,"variant":true,"regions":[{"susceptible":92588,"infected":445990,"recovered":447543,"dead":13879,"gdp":15958,"lockdown":0,"testing":0,"gates":[0,0,0],"newInfections":162146,"deathsWeek":4890,"confirmed":66898,"confirmedNew":24321,"grossGdp":396,"spendWeek":45,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":3},{"susceptible":915711,"infected":31977,"recovered":51818,"dead":494,"gdp":11380,"lockdown":4,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":13933,"deathsWeek":129,"confirmed":28779,"confirmedNew":12539,"grossGdp":374,"spendWeek":220,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":2},{"susceptible":933289,"infected":15582,"recovered":50730,"dead":399,"gdp":12101,"lockdown":3,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":6474,"deathsWeek":39,"confirmed":14023,"confirmedNew":5826,"grossGdp":600,"spendWeek":245,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":1},{"susceptible":924722,"infected":27994,"recovered":46877,"dead":407,"gdp":11611,"lockdown":3,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":13187,"deathsWeek":91,"confirmed":25194,"confirmedNew":11868,"grossGdp":586,"spendWeek":220,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":2},{"susceptible":853556,"infected":51020,"recovered":93936,"dead":1488,"gdp":11638,"lockdown":2,"testing":3,"gates":[1,1,1],"newInfections":22433,"deathsWeek":327,"confirmed":45918,"confirmedNew":20189,"grossGdp":719,"spendWeek":185,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":3},{"susceptible":752944,"infected":141087,"recovered":103625,"dead":2344,"gdp":8270,"lockdown":1,"testing":3,"gates":[2,2,2],"newInfections":71859,"deathsWeek":1192,"confirmed":126978,"confirmedNew":64673,"grossGdp":672,"spendWeek":220,"aidIn":0,"aidOut":0,"hospital":3}]},{"kind":"dial","week":18,"seat":0,"pos":5,"region":"Saltmarch","lockdown":1,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Wintermoor","gate":2},{"to":"Harborlea","gate":2},{"to":"Riverbend","gate":2}],"aid":[],"say":"W18→W19: Saltmarch 141086 true (14.1%), deaths 1192/wk, hospitals 4x over. All borders sealed. Prevalence still rising but death rate now critical cost driver.","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"WEEK 18 ANALYSIS: True prevalence 14.1% (141086 cases), new ~86500 this week (reported 64673 / 0.90). Death rate 1192/wk = 3.2%/week (hospitals 4x over cap). At effective Beta ~1.15*0.64*0.90*1.25 (variant)=0.828 with closed borders, doubling time ~3 weeks. All three roads sealed (cost 90). Ledger 8270 solid. Harborlea remains catastrophe: 66898@T0=446000 true (44.6%), Wintermoor 45918@T3=51020 true (5.1%). Kestrel/Riverbend/Ash under control at L3/T3. HOLD COURSE: L1/T3/all gates 2. Death cost (2 credits each, tripled when over capacity) now dominates math—every death = -6 effective credits, so suppression through lockdown beats opening. Hospitals critical means don't ease lockdown yet. Pr…"},{"kind":"dial","week":18,"seat":1,"pos":4,"region":"Wintermoor","lockdown":2,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":1},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":1},{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":1}],"aid":[],"say":"W18→W19: Wintermoor 5.1% prevalence, deaths 327/wk, hospitals critical. Variant accelerating. Need coordinated L3+ from all neighbours to break transmission ch…","scripted":false,"corrected":false,"text":"W18 ANALYSIS: Reported 45918 (+20189), deaths 327 (up 120 from 207), hospitals critical. De-biased ~51020 true (5.1% of population). CRITICAL ESCALATION: new case rate jumped 9% week-on-week despite L2/T3 screening gates. This confirms variant is dominating transmission. Deaths spiking suggests 1-week lag from exponential growth phase around W16. LEDGER: 11638 credits after gross 719, spend 185. SCORE: 8662 (heavily penalized by deaths). CRISIS ASSESSMENT: Harborlea (16.5% de-biased), Saltmarch (127k reported, ~152k true at T3 = 15.2%), Kestrel Flats (4.3%), Riverbend (3.3%), Ash Hollow (3.9%), Wintermoor (5.1%). Two regions in severe crisis; Wintermoor approaching critical zone. Our screen…"},{"kind":"dial","week":18,"seat":2,"pos":2,"region":"Riverbend","lockdown":3,"testing":3,"borders":[{"to":"Kestrel Flats","gate":2},{"to":"Ash Hollow","gate":2},{"to":"Saltmarch","gate":2}],"aid":[],"scripted":true,"